WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:07.370
Speaker 1: Hey, among all of this bad stuff
going on, let me talk briefly about something

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:08.370
really exciting.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:09.370
We're approaching one billion.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.210
That's with a B one billion YouTube views.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.500
You might remember that last September, right
around September 15th, fourteenth, twelfth,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.130
something like that, we hit an important milestone,
one million YouTube subscriptions, one million

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.130
YouTube subscribers.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.520
We are now already almost 40 percent.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.180
Beyond that, we're almost at one point four
million subscribers.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.110
We've seen 40 percent subscriber growth in
the last 11 months.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:27.110
It's incredible.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.400
But now we're moving on to views.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.199
You can have tons of subscriptions all over
the place.

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:40.130
But if those people aren't watching your videos,
it's basically worth nothing.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.600
And some channels have that situation.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.070
Millions of subscribers, almost no views.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:53.290
We are now approaching a billion YouTube views.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:57.460
Listen to how nuts the growth is.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:04.519
Last year at this time, our entire channel
had six hundred million views.

00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:09.549
The last four hundred million views are coming
and basically one year, which is insane.

00:01:09.549 --> 00:01:14.820
And I have only you to thank for that.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.950
We are now at nine hundred eighty nine million
views.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.930
That's about ten and a half million away from
one billion.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.460
Now, how long is this going to take?

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:27.950
We often get a million views in a day, but
not every day.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:29.970
So it could be nine days.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:34.479
If we had a really strong nine days, more
likely it would be something like two to two

00:01:34.479 --> 00:01:35.479
and a half weeks.

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:36.740
So what are we doing for this?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:42.720
First of all, we're putting together a fantastic
billion view compilation with a nice counter

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.049
rolling up to a billion.

00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:48.619
It's going to start with old clips and go
all the way through.

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:52.939
There's going to be classics in there that
many of our newer viewers and listeners may

00:01:52.939 --> 00:01:53.939
never have seen.

00:01:53.939 --> 00:01:54.939
So we're putting that together.

00:01:54.939 --> 00:01:59.090
It's going to be like an eight or nine minute
long clip producer that's been doing a great

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:00.090
job with it.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.130
And it's going to be ready.

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:06.130
It'll.

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:10.899
Be ready to be triggered by us surpassing
one billion views.

00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:11.919
That's number one.

00:02:11.919 --> 00:02:17.180
Number two, yes, there's going to be a huge
membership special at one billion.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.519
Of course there is.

00:02:18.519 --> 00:02:19.650
You better believe it.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.189
We are going to blow membership's out of here
like you wouldn't believe, like nobody's ever

00:02:24.189 --> 00:02:25.189
seen before.

00:02:25.189 --> 00:02:30.040
In fact, just get on my newsletter at David
Pakman dot com to be notified.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.230
There's no specific date because we don't
know when we're going to hit the billion.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.449
And then number three, we want this.

00:02:34.449 --> 00:02:35.510
We've never tried this before.

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:38.249
OK, here, this is just an idea.

00:02:38.249 --> 00:02:43.709
We want to try to make a compilation of people
from the audience calling in to other shows.

00:02:43.709 --> 00:02:48.340
They can be left wing shows or right wing
shows and somehow mentioning David Pakman

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.029
show YouTube, one billion views.

00:02:50.029 --> 00:02:54.319
It can be just like a you call a friendly
show.

00:02:54.319 --> 00:03:00.809
And you might mention, hey, will you be congratulating
The David Pakman Show on a billion views?

00:03:00.809 --> 00:03:02.489
It can be trolling of right wing shows, whatever.

00:03:02.489 --> 00:03:08.069
The only thing is just David Pakman show a
