00:03:14.219 --> 00:03:16.319
Can we get it in front of Mike Lyndell?

00:03:16.319 --> 00:03:17.319
Can we get him?

00:03:17.319 --> 00:03:18.319
Who knows?

00:03:18.319 --> 00:03:22.370
Dan Bongino with all these people?

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:26.249
Charlie SPORCK and then send us a link.

00:03:26.249 --> 00:03:32.930
